  "steps": [
    "In a large air-fryer-safe tray, combine the boiled soya nuggets, paneer, mushrooms, onion, capsicum, bell peppers and broccoli.",
    "Add hung curd, ginger-garlic paste, turmeric, red chilli powder, coriander powder, garam masala and salt. Mix gently until everything is coated.",
    "For the tadka, heat oil in a small pan. Add besan and cook briefly, stirring continuously. Add Kashmiri red chilli powder and crushed kasuri methi, and mix well over low heat.",
    "Pour the besan tadka into the tray and mix everything gently to coat evenly.",
    "Air fry at 180°C for 12 minutes. For more char, air fry for an additional 2–3 minutes.",
    "Serve hot with green chutney."
  ],
